The semantic layer does not implement unions yet.

semantic/metac_type_semantic.c has an empty `case type_union:` branch, so
MetaCSemantic_TypeSemantic returns 0 and the assertion

    metac_type_semantic.c:1523: MetaCSemantic_TypeSemantic:
        Assertion `result.v != 0' failed.

fires.  The same happens on the unmodified compiler.
